    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 30-layer planar dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence is alternating HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) starting with HfO2 at the air side (30 layers total: HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)/HfO2/SiO2 (Lemarchand)). Optimize all 30 layer thicknesses with gradient_thickness optimizer. Initialize thickness perturbation distribution centered between 80 nm and 95 nm. Reduce optimizer step size by 20% from previous iteration. Spectral targets: maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band, maximize reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Add soft penalty term targeting tightest_margin > 0.5. Total layer count fixed at 30. Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) only.",
